warning
# Issue #1859: dead-man's switch for the notify file sink. Fires at most
# once per staleness-bound interval while the digest stays stale (bound:
# NOTIFY_DIGEST_STALE_HOURS = 72h, sized from the daemon digest's measured
# healthy-gap max of 47.1h) -- the writer-dead shape the daemon hid for
# three weeks. The interval re-fire keeps a fresh event inside the
# heartbeat consumer's lookback window for the whole episode. Warning, not
# error: a quiet-but-healthy fleet can legitimately emit no attention
# transitions for days, so this is a tripwire for an operator to
# investigate, not a proven outage.
